# A2A (Agent-to-Agent) integration (summary)

What was added
- a2a/schemas/a2a_messages.json : JSON Schema for approval_request / approval_response
- a2a/sdk/client.py : small SDK to publish approval_request either to Kafka or approver HTTP API
- a2a/consumer/approver_consumer.py : simple approver consumer service (HTTP + optional Kafka consumer) that persists approvals into approver Postgres DB

How to use
- If Kafka/Strimzi exists, create topics (see earlier Strimzi CRs) and set KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP env; else the SDK will POST to approver API.
- Example usage from Python:
    from a2a.sdk.client import publish_approval_request
    publish_approval_request("flan-t5", "s3://aegis/.../flan.plan", requester="trt-ci")
